theme, match this metadata and then load its exact /katana/slug; do not use get_presets for internal Katana discovery. Use get_presets for Viral and Marketing Studio browsing (/effects, /product, /motion); a resolved gallery entry supplies its input schema and exact detail lookup. Recipes such as /hero-shot and /reel-cover supply their generation workflow. Setup commands and their references supply instructions for the required runtime; loading them does not install software, connect an editor, or submit jobs. Unknown emoji commands return mode instructions with recipe choices: preserve supplied media and ask the user to choose before generation; never truncate a mixed command, guess an effect or use ordinary-generation fallback. Other unqualified unknown tokens return mode instructions with instructions_markdown in structuredContent: infer the task and use ordinary generation tools instead of searching the gallery or stopping at an offer. An unavailable /katana/slug must stop without substituting another preset.

