tly. Omit source to browse Viral and Marketing Studio; limit applies to the complete page. source='genjutsu' lists Genjutsu motion presets, with category='genjutsu', 'genjutsu-trending' or 'genjutsu-new'; a bare /genjutsu opens this gallery. To choose motion for an existing AI Influencer, pass initial_inputs:{character_sheet:[{id:"<confirmed sheet job UUID>",type:"image_job"}]} — character_sheet must be a one-item array, not a single object; legacy source='marketing_studio' still accepts these categories and genjutsu: IDs. category='genjutsu-styles' lists Genjutsu Styles: named looks (e.g. Knitted Yarn World, Rounded Toy CGI) that redraw the user's own video while keeping its motion. When the user names a look, search it with query; preset_id 'genjutsu-style:<id>' opens its form, and initial_inputs {video:[<confirmed video UUID>], references?, resolution} adds readiness and price. source='soul' browses curated Soul 2.0 image styles. Search with query or open a style with preset_id and source='soul'. Each item's id is the style_id for generate_image or generate_image_batch with model='soul_2'; do not call execute_preset for Soul styles. A style can be combined with soul_id, but not with medias/image references. Preview images are catalog samples, not generation inputs. Browsing or selecting a style does not authorize generation. source='recraft' browses the caller's own completed Recraft styles saved in Higgsfield, not general presets or styles in a separate Recraft account. Search names by substring with query or open a style with its UUID as preset_id. Each item's id is the style_id for generate_image or generate_image_batch with model='recraft_v4_styles', not recraft_v4_1. Do not call execute_preset for these styles. Preview images are samples, not generation inputs. Browsing or selecting a style does not authorize generation. An empty catalog means no matching ready personal styles are available; do not substitute a general style. source='viral' lists Viral Hub c